{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣女星徐若瑄當年14歲便出道，多年來保養得宜，亮眼外貌與纖細身形可謂十年如一日﹗如今年屆51歲的她近日於社交群組晒出18歲與51歲的對比照，凍齡技術高超令全網驚呼﹕「根本永遠18歲。</p><p>」原來這張對比照是她一位姐妹傳來的，左邊18歲的徐若瑄青</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:25.476616+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:01:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076132+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076132+00:00","content_hash":"2fe7a133cfdda0f57d04e18d4ca0deaefe373f990f8714cb20a834c179bc3bb4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}